#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""gcm - Git Commit Message generator (free, via Groq API).

Doc staged diff, nho LLM viet message Conventional Commits, review roi commit.
Khong can API tra phi (Groq free tier). Thuan stdlib, khong can pip install.

Staging:
  gcm -s             Chon file de stage (nhap so)
  gcm -t             Chon file kieu TUI toan man hinh (↑↓/PgUp/PgDn, space
                     tick, a/i tat ca/dao, d xem diff cuon duoc, q huy)
  gcm -a             git add -A truoc khi sinh

Message:
  gcm -m "hint"      Them ngu canh/goi y cho message
  gcm --vi / --en    Message tieng Viet / English
  gcm --model NAME   Doi model cho lan chay nay

Commit & push:
  gcm -y             Commit luon, khong hoi
  gcm --push         Tu push sau khi commit
  gcm --amend        Sua (reword) commit gan nhat
  gcm -p             Chi in message, khong commit

Khac:
  gcm --gui          Mo giao dien chon repo + sinh message
  gcm config         Xem config hien tai (kem nguon: mac dinh/file/env)
  gcm config set KEY VALUE / unset KEY / path
  gcm -u             Tu cap nhat gcm len ban moi nhat (git pull)
  gcm -h             Tro giup

Khi review: [Enter] commit . [p] commit+push . [e] sua . [r] tao lai
  [m] them goi y roi tao lai . [d] xem diff da stage . [n] huy
Neu chua stage gi ma working tree co thay doi, gcm tu mo bo chon file (nhap
so: '1 3', '2-5', 'a' tat ca, '-2' bo file 2, 'i' dao, 'd 3' xem diff, 't' TUI).
Chay ngoai git repo: gcm tu mo giao dien de chon repo (khong co GUI thi bao loi).
Lockfile/binary van duoc commit nhung khong gui noi dung cho LLM.

Config: ~/.config/gcm/config.json (JSON). Mac dinh nam trong code, file cua
ban CHI chua nhung key muon khac mac dinh - key nao vang mat thi theo built-in:
  {
    "api_key": "gsk_...",        key free tai https://console.groq.com/keys
    "lang": "vi",                vi | en - ngon ngu mac dinh cua message
    "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b",
    "tui": true,                 mac dinh chon file kieu TUI
    "push": "ask",               ask | always | never
    "coauthor": "Ten <email>",   'Co-authored-by' khi push ("off" de tat)
    "system_prompt": "..."       override cach AI viet message
  }
Key bat dau bang "//" la ghi chu (JSON khong co comment). File mau day du:
~/.config/gcm/config.example.json. File cu dang 'key = value' se duoc tu dong
chuyen sang JSON o lan chay dau.
Uu tien: flag CLI > env > config.json > mac dinh built-in. `gcm config` in ro
tung key dang lay tu dau. Env: GROQ_API_KEY, GCM_MODEL.
System prompt (uu tien): file ~/.config/gcm/system_prompt.md > key
  "system_prompt" > mac dinh. Placeholder {lang} = cau chi dinh ngon ngu.
API key: env > config.json > key nhung san luc build (neu ban build co).
"""
